CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790138893
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AArticle: published on 22 September 2026
OL,4,
OL,5,FIn the expansive grasslands of Inner
OL,6,FMongolia, farmers are picking plump
OL,7,Fpotatoes alongside new neighbours:
OL,8,Fhuge, rectangular blocks that will fuel
OL,9,FChina's AI platforms.
OL,11,FUlanqab, with its steppes and
OL,12,Fvolcanoes, is an unlikely digital
OL,13,Ffrontier. For years, it has been
OL,14,FChina's official "potato capital". But
OL,15,Fnow its fields have also become
OL,16,Fconstruction sites for a slew of data
OL,17,Fcentres, as Donald Trump and his
OL,18,FChinese counterpart Xi Jinping meet to
OL,19,Fdiscuss AI safety among other things.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790138893
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AArticle: published on 22 September 2026
OL,4,
OL,5,FHundreds of workers in yellow helmets
OL,6,Fcarry heavy equipment into the building
OL,7,Fsite as welding sparks fly off metal
OL,8,Fscaffolding. Above them huge cranes
OL,9,Fmove with precision to build rooftops,
OL,10,Fwhile men balance on ladders to plaster
OL,11,Fbrickwork.
OL,13,F"This is China speed," jokes one
OL,14,Fworker. "An infrastructure maniac," is
OL,15,Fhow he describes his country, laughing
OL,16,Fas he walks away. "There is one phase
OL,17,Fevery year. This is the second phase,"
OL,18,Fexplains an electrical engineer. "There
OL,19,Fwill be many more phases afterwards."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
